# Spec: form-layout

## Contract

A flexible two-column form layout with label/input pairs arranged in rows, supporting full-width fields, text inputs, selects, and textareas. Footer contains cancel and submit buttons.

## Dependencies

- button-primary
- button-danger

## Slots

| Slot | Description |
|------|-------------|
| form-row | Wraps 1-2 form-field elements in a horizontal row |
| form-field | Label + input/select/textarea pair |
| form-field.full | Full-width field spanning both columns |
| form-footer | Action buttons container |

## Boundaries

- Grid uses 2-column layout (1fr 1fr)
- Full-width fields use `.full` class to span all columns
- Minimum 0 for number inputs
- Cancel button is optional (hidden when onCancel not provided)
- Fields default to empty string if no default value provided

## Examples

### Two-Column Form with Mixed Fields

```
名稱        分類
[輸入框]    [下拉選單]

數量        狀態
[數字輸入]  [下拉選單]

備註
[文字區塊 textarea        ]

              [取消] [儲存]
```

### Single Row with Full-Width Field

```
名稱        分類
[輸入框]    [下拉選單]

備註 (full-width)
[文字區塊                ]

              [取消] [儲存]
```

---

[html]
```html
<form class="form-layout" id="main-form">
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-field">
      <label for="field-name">名稱</label>
      <input type="text" id="field-name" name="name" placeholder="請輸入" />
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
      <label for="field-category">分類</label>
      <select id="field-category" name="category">
        <option value="">請選擇</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-field">
      <label for="field-quantity">數量</label>
      <input type="number" id="field-quantity" name="quantity" min="0" />
    </div>
    <div class="form-field">
      <label for="field-status">狀態</label>
      <select id="field-status" name="status">
        <option value="active">啟用</option>
        <option value="inactive">停用</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-field full">
    <label for="field-note">備註</label>
    <textarea id="field-note" name="note" rows="3" placeholder="選填"></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="form-footer">
    <button type="button" class="btn-cancel">取消</button>
    <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">儲存</button>
  </div>
</form>
```

[react]
```jsx
const FormLayout = ({ fields = [], onSubmit, onCancel }) => {
  const [form, setForm] = React.useState(() => {
    const init = {};
    fields.forEach(f => { init[f.name] = f.default || ''; });
    return init;
  });
  return (
    <form className="form-layout" onSubmit={e => { e.preventDefault(); onSubmit(form); }}>
      <div className="form-row">
        {fields.filter(f => f.row === 1 || !f.row).map(field => (
          <div key={field.name} className="form-field">
            <label htmlFor={"field-" + field.name}>{field.label}</label>
            {field.type === 'select' ? (
              <select id={"field-" + field.name} value={form[field.name]} onChange={e => setForm({...form, [field.name]: e.target.value})}>
                <option value="">請選擇</option>
                {(field.options || []).map(opt => <option key={opt.value} value={opt.value}>{opt.label}</option>)}
              </select>
            ) : field.type === 'textarea' ? (
              <textarea id={"field-" + field.name} rows={3} value={form[field.name]} onChange={e => setForm({...form, [field.name]: e.target.value})} placeholder={field.placeholder || ''} />
            ) : (
              <input type={field.type || 'text'} id={"field-" + field.name} value={form[field.name]} onChange={e => setForm({...form, [field.name]: e.target.value})} placeholder={field.placeholder || ''} />
            )}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div className="form-footer">
        {onCancel && <button type="button" className="btn-cancel" onClick={onCancel}>取消</button>}
        <button type="submit" className="btn-primary">儲存</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  );
};
```

[style]
```css
.form-layout { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
.form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
.form-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.form-field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.form-field label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #374151; }
.form-field input, .form-field select, .form-field textarea {
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: border-color 0.15s;
}
.form-field input:focus, .form-field select:focus, .form-field textarea:focus {
  outline: none; border-color: #3b82f6;
}
.form-footer { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 8px; }
.btn-cancel { padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; }
.btn-cancel:hover { background: #f9fafb; }
```
